# Everything the running system writes. Tracking any of it would leave every
# install sitting on a dirty tree, and ./karamel update refuses to run on one.
#
# Each directory has to be un-ignored before anything inside it can be, which is
# why this is three stanzas rather than one. The first version ignored the
# .gitkeep markers along with everything else, so two directories the installer
# expects simply did not exist after a clone.
data/*
!data/intakes/
!data/tenants/
!data/voice_cards/
data/intakes/*
data/tenants/*
data/voice_cards/*
!data/intakes/_QUESTIONNAIRE.md
!data/intakes/_template.json
!data/intakes/.gitkeep
!data/tenants/.gitkeep
!data/voice_cards/.gitkeep

.karamel
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
